license             MIT
maintainers         {@jaiganesh6999:jaiganesh6999} openmaintainer

description         Lightweight website SEO audit tool and CLI by SEOWebChecker
long_description    SEOWebChecker is an open-source technical SEO audit client and CLI tool \
                    for on-page analysis, meta tag validation, heading hierarchy verification, \
                    and Core Web Vitals checks.

